Revision 3:

List of stuff that's going to be implemented (discuss in#lojban or lojban-list, or edit this page if you disagree/have improvements):
*new s family, see jbotcan: ::{img src=http://jbotcan.org/src/1207645730298.png}::
*proposal to have breaks in markable letters, so you can mark them without backtracking, see jbotcan: {img src=http://jbotcan.org/src/1207644286070.png}{img src=http://jbotcan.org/src/1207644948816.png}
* revive small vowels (as if you noticed they were big)
* revive regular kerning, cos rev2 looks ugly and think that's the culprit
* M and N are to be a flick-separated pair again
* L and R are to be flick-separated pair again as well, but using the rev2 L (L3 = L2, R3 = L2+flick)
* X is tentatively a double-stroke on S3 (see pic) (X3 = S3+stroke+stroke, or C3+stroke if you like)
* .y'y may go back to rev1, in which case X3 will probably stay the same as X2. ''This is one we need opinions on' Drop in #lojban
